{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.hinana.second",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "第一次去看她的课",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.hinana.second",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.hinana.second",
    "idolId": "hinana",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "啊～♡是制作人～～～！",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "诶……啊，雛菜啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "诶～～～制作人，好冷淡～……？",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "抱歉，刚才一边走路一边想事情，不太好呢。",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "不好～！不危险吗～？",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "走路还要想事情，多辛苦啊～～～……",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "制作人，有在休息的时候吗～……？",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哈哈，一不小心就……",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "啊不过！雛菜也是，一边想着制作人一边走过来的～♡",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "这样吗？那就是彼此彼此了。",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "我在想，今后该怎么制作雛菜。",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "骗人～～～！",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "我还在想是不是只有雛菜一个人在想着制作人，好开心～～～",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "那太好了。雛菜今天也很有精神呢。",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "啊哈，对吧～～～？今天也要一天开开心心～、幸幸福福～♡",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……今天也要一天，啊……雛菜，今天接下来有课吧？",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "我能去看看课的样子吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "制作人也要来？呀哈～♡那最棒了～～～！",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "呐，快点走吧～～～？制作人。",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（……那就是今天的课。）",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "真的～～～？呀哈～，被夸了～♡",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "啊，制作人在看～～～？被夸了哦～～～！",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "喂，正在上课吧……！",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "可是，因为太开心了～就想跟制作人说～～～",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "别管这边，专心上课……！",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "那制作人就专心看着雛菜哦～？",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "好了，快，朝前面……！",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "好～♡课的后续就拜托了～～～",
        "nextNodeId": "29"
      },
      "29": {
        "id": "29",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "…………哈哈……",
        "nextNodeId": "30"
      },
      "30": {
        "id": "30",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（……舞蹈也跳得好，更重要的是这份天真烂漫，正适合当偶像。）",
        "nextNodeId": "31"
      },
      "31": {
        "id": "31",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（稍微有点任性这一点让人在意……）",
        "nextNodeId": "32"
      },
      "32": {
        "id": "32",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "……制作人看～～～？",
        "nextNodeId": "33"
      },
      "33": {
        "id": "33",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "………………",
        "nextNodeId": "34"
      },
      "34": {
        "id": "34",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "制作人……？",
        "nextNodeId": "35"
      },
      "35": {
        "id": "35",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "诶……啊，雛菜！辛苦了。",
        "nextNodeId": "36"
      },
      "36": {
        "id": "36",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "……又在想事情吗～？",
        "choices": [
          {
            "label": "在想怎么制作雛菜。",
            "nextNodeId": "100"
          },
          {
            "label": "在想雛菜跳舞真好。",
            "nextNodeId": "120"
          },
          {
            "label": "在想雛菜会变成好偶像。",
            "nextNodeId": "140"
          }
        ]
      },
      "100": {
        "id": "100",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "啊哈，制作人老是这个～～～",
        "nextNodeId": "101"
      },
      "101": {
        "id": "101",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "是啊。就是因为对雛菜有这么多可能性。",
        "nextNodeId": "102"
      },
      "102": {
        "id": "102",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "诶～～～？那是在说雛菜很厉害～？",
        "nextNodeId": "103"
      },
      "103": {
        "id": "103",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯，雛菜一定能成为很厉害的偶像。",
        "nextNodeId": "104"
      },
      "104": {
        "id": "104",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "为了那个，我一直在想怎么做最好。",
        "nextNodeId": "105"
      },
      "105": {
        "id": "105",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "呀哈～♡那雛菜就等着了哦～？"
      },
      "120": {
        "id": "120",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "呀哈～♡被制作人夸了～～～",
        "nextNodeId": "121"
      },
      "121": {
        "id": "121",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "以后多上课，还能跳得更好。",
        "nextNodeId": "122"
      },
      "122": {
        "id": "122",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "雛菜，也许有跳舞的才能～",
        "nextNodeId": "123"
      },
      "123": {
        "id": "123",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯，我期待着。",
        "nextNodeId": "124"
      },
      "124": {
        "id": "124",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "嘿嘿～♡那雛菜就多跳一点～～～！"
      },
      "140": {
        "id": "140",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "真的～～～？好开心～！",
        "nextNodeId": "141"
      },
      "141": {
        "id": "141",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "舞蹈也跳得好，更重要的是总是那么开朗、那么开心。",
        "nextNodeId": "142"
      },
      "142": {
        "id": "142",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "要是能把那样的样子给粉丝看到就好了。",
        "nextNodeId": "143"
      },
      "143": {
        "id": "143",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "嗯～♡雛菜，那个大概很擅长～～～！"
      }
    }
  },
